[Opening "Bishop's Opening"]
[Side "White"]
[Result "*"]

1. e4 e5 2. Bc4 Nc6 3. Nf3 {Now it is the Italian Game – and you already know it!} Nf6 4. d3 Be7 5. O-O O-O 6. Re1 d6 7. c3 *

[Event "Bishop's Opening: 2...Bc5"]
[Opening "Bishop's Opening"]
[Side "White"]
